<!--
Deep Ocean: three swells.

  No fish, no shell, no anchor. The other two marks are silhouettes of a
  thing that stands in the zone; water has no silhouette, and the honest
  drawing of it is its surface.

  Drawn in white and tinted at the call site with the zone's own ZoneAccent, so
  one drawable serves whatever colour the floor plan gives an area. A fourth
  zone next year needs a path, not a palette.
-->
